# --- External-data corpus (see docs/data-management.md) ---
# The built knowledge base is derived data and lives OUTSIDE git: rebuild it with
# scripts/ingest.py or fetch a bundle with scripts/fetch_data.py. Only the small
# committed sample (for demos/tests) is kept in-repo.
data/knowledge/**/*.jsonl
!data/knowledge/sample/*.jsonl
# Local corpus bundles
data/bundles/

